For simplicity of hardware implementation, we assume a fixed PA coupling length $L_{\text{PA}} = {\arcsin\left(\sqrt{{1}/{N}}\right)}/{\kappa_c}$ and a frequency-independent refractive index $n_{\rm{p}} = 1.5$.
