In this section, we present the formalized algorithm for the \InsertKeywords{} operation. Both the \HumanMode{} and \AutoMode{} modes are documented in Algorithm \ref{alg:insert_keywords}. In addition, we present the \FindKeywords{} subroutine. 

\begin{algorithm}[h]  
