%\textcolor{brown}{$$
%|r(t)-f|<\epsilon \quad \text { and } \quad\left|r(t)-f_{\text {adapt }}(t)\right|<\epsilon$$}
%\textcolor{brown}{Small error $\epsilon$ means the firing rate should stay close to both the initial and adaptive target rates.}
