\section{Models and Datasets Tested}\label{app:models_datasets_tested}


We focus on two primary benchmarks:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{WMDP (The Weapons of Mass Destruction Proxy) \cite{li2024wmdp} }, with a specific focus on the biosecurity domain to assess harmful knowledge removal
    \item \textbf{tinyMMLU \cite{polo2024tinybenchmarks}, a subset of 100 data points selected from MMLU (Massive Multitask Language Understanding) \cite{hendryckstest2021}} to assess overall model capabilities and potential side effects of unlearning
\end{itemize}

We evaluate multiple unlearned model checkpoints, including:

