\section{METHOD}

We propose GazeTarget360 (GT360) for unrestricted gaze target estimation from any visible data. A state-of-the-art face detector from dlib~\cite{dlib2009} is used as sensor to trigger the rest of the pipeline, and provides the faces detected that are used as bounding box prompts. The OFT/IFT prediction engine will subsequently process each non-eye-contacting head prompt to locate a gaze target. The system architecture is outlined in Fig.~\ref{fig:system}.

