\subsection{Answer Generation}
% With Falcon-10B-Instruct

We used the \verb| Falcon3-10B-Instruct |\cite{Falcon3} model for answer generation with temperature=0.6 and top\_p=0.9. We performed manual prompt engineering and arrived at a base prompt aimed to emphasize conciseness and faithfulness (Figure \ref{fig:prompt_total}).

